(subscriptions to improve customer lifetime value.**Break-even**We estimate initial fixed) '
(operating costs of approximately **Rs 5 lakh/month** for the product, infrastructure,) '
(marketing, and lean team.At an estimated contribution of roughly **Rs 120 per premium) '
(subscriber per month**, FitBite would need approximately **4,200 active premium) '
(subscribers** to reach monthly operating break-even.As the user base grows, we expect) '
(software economics and annual subscriptions to improve operating leverage.) '
